\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af11\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang4105\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang4105\kerning1\dbch\af9\langfe2052{\hich\af6\loch\cf1\fs20\f6\loch
CRA uses sophisticated security techniques to protect its Internet filing Web services. You're responsible for ensuring that your own computer is secure. While the CRA has taken all reasonable efforts to ensure the security of information in transit to the CRA, it is not liable for any damages that may arise as the result of interception, loss, or other action or difficulty. You should also make sure your return was completed with the latest version of your certified software. In some cases not updating your software will prevent you from being able to use this Web service.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af11\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang4105\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang4105\kerning1\dbch\af9\langfe2052\loch

